[h1]Deadly Night[/h1]
Now, between challenging and pro difficulty, you'll go through a pretty dark night! It's best to equip your weapons with flashlights!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44715298/5846981c695475233bda283f64a23998d96b8608.png[/img]

[h1]Forest Map[/h1]
In this new map, zombies spawn in 4 regions, but you have a big advantage with not many obstacles.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44715298/43b69acb6acb71b7b89ef4916b6183a5191de2ca.png[/img]

[h1]Endless Mode[/h1]
By pressing the skull next to start, you enter an endless mode, where slowly, the number of zombies keeps increasing until it reaches its limit!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44715298/c6338aaf5afffb20b155d621ecb06c727b417383.png[/img]

[h1]Zombie Spreading System[/h1]
While zombies are far from you, they'll oscillate their positions to spread better across the map.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44715298/847ff131791c998d70ec1b1d12b5d1397f650e8a.png[/img]

Added Stuff:
➣ Bullets have speed set according to the weapon;
➢ Christmas beanie;
➣ Bar in the map selection menu;
➢ New tips in the tutorial carousel.

Modifications:
➣ The character rotates smoothly now;
➣ Adjustment in the lighting and fog of the maps;
➣ From challenging difficulty, it's night, and from pro, it's bloodmoon;
➣ Special zombie speed modifier was halved.

Fixed Issues:
➢ Achievement for all purchased weapons not triggering;
➢ Camera glitching when a zombie passed in front;
➣ Tutorial carousel had no back button;
➢ Weapon fire rate didn't work correctly when clicking multiple times.
